#! ia 1.0

@contract draft-authoring-runtime-contract
  version "0.1.0"
  meaning
    says "Draft validation and formatting require contextual admission and leave source publication to the caller."
    answers "What do validate-ia and format-ia return for admitted drafts and refuse for malformed source?"
  relationships
    governs @operation validate-ia
    governs @operation format-ia
  invariants
    REQ-DRAFT-VALIDATE "For a safe target in the current complete authored workspace, validate-ia admits valid source without returning artifacts; malformed source refuses with IA-EXEC-VALIDATION-FAILED and no source is written."
    REQ-DRAFT-FORMAT "For a safe target in the current complete authored workspace, format-ia returns one normalized draft only after formatting and contextual admission succeed; malformed source refuses with IA-EXEC-VALIDATION-FAILED and no source is written."
